        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, evocation, fire)\n\nThe grave karina breathes a cloud of burning ash in 30-foot cone that deals 9d8 fire damage (30 basic Reflex save). The area becomes filled with ash for 1 round. All creatures within the cloud of ash become concealed, and all creatures outside the cloud become concealed to creatures within it. The grave karina can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Grave Blight**\nDC: 27\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\n- Stage 1: carrier with no ill effect (1 day)\n- Stage 2: 2d6 poison damage, and sickened 1 (1 day)\n- Stage 3: 2d8 poison damage, every hour the victim must succeed at another Fortitude save or be confused for 1 minute, and sickened 2 (1 day)"
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
